destination.description:
Adapter-specific destination string. Each adapter defines its own
format (e.g. Slack: `channel:C123` / `dm:D123` / `thread:C/ts`;
Linear: `issue:LIN-123`).

keyFingerprint.description:
Short digest of the stored signing key. Enough to tell two keys apart;
the key itself is never returned. Absent for the login App, whose key
is not stored.

oneOf.description:
For `Agent` tool-use blocks only: a derived summary of the spawned
subagent's activity. Injected post-transform from a batched aggregate;
absent on non-`Agent` blocks and on the live `subagentProgress` path.
